WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:03.136
RUSSIAN-BACKED MERCENARIES ARE
CLAIMING VICTORY OVER THE

00:00:03.136 --> 00:00:05.672
ENTIRE INDUSTRIAL TOWN OF
SOLEDAR.

00:00:05.672 --> 00:00:09.209
UKRAINE'S MILITARY ADMITS
FIERCE BATTLES ARE GOING ON

00:00:09.209 --> 00:00:12.112
THERE.
BUT SAYS THAT ITS FORCES HAVE

00:00:12.112 --> 00:00:15.115
THINGS UNDER CONTROL.
THE BATTLE FOR SOLEDAD'S

00:00:15.115 --> 00:00:18.051
BLOODY.
A UKRAINIAN SOLDIER TELLS CNN

00:00:18.051 --> 00:00:21.121
THAT THE DEATH TOLL IS NOW SO
HIGH THAT THEY'VE STOPPED

00:00:21.121 --> 00:00:24.324
COUNTING THE DEAD.
SOLEDAD IS LOCATED IN THE

00:00:24.324 --> 00:00:27.994
DONETSK REGION.
NOT FAR FROM THE CITY OF

00:00:27.994 --> 00:00:30.063
BUCKINGHAM.
TO THE BIGGEST SALT MINE IN

00:00:30.063 --> 00:00:32.298
EUROPE.
AND A VAST NETWORK OF

00:00:32.298 --> 00:00:37.170
UNDERGROUND TUNNELS.
WHICH RUSSIAN FORCES ARE LIKELY

00:00:37.170 --> 00:00:40.073
TO EXPLOIT.
MORE NOW ON THE FIGHTING IN

00:00:40.073 --> 00:00:42.509
SOLIDARITY FROM CNN'S SCOTT
MCLAIN.

00:00:42.509 --> 00:00:48.214
REPORTING FROM KYIV.
&gt;&gt; SMOKE BILLOWS OVER THE SALT

00:00:48.214 --> 00:00:50.550
MINES IN SOLEDAR.
EASTERN UKRAINE.

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:54.187
THIS SMALL TOWN NOW THE SCENE
OF SOME OF THE FIERCEST

00:00:54.187 --> 00:01:01.327
FIGHTING IN THE 11TH MONTH WAR.
VIDEO FILMED BY A SOLDIER ON

00:01:01.327 --> 00:01:06.299
THE FRONTLINE SHOWS THE HOUSE
TO HOUSE STYLE FIGHTING.

00:01:06.299 --> 00:01:10.103
TROOPS ARE NOW LOCKED INTO.
THE TANK IS WORKING, DID YOU

00:01:10.103 --> 00:01:12.205
HEAR?
UKRAINIAN FIGHTER SAYS.

00:01:12.205 --> 00:01:14.674
THE STREETS LITTERED WITH
DEBRIS.

00:01:14.674 --> 00:01:18.211
AS FIGHTERS BATTLE FOR CONTROL
OF THE STRATEGIC TOWN.

00:01:18.211 --> 00:01:21.981
THIS PART OF THE WAR'S
FRONTLINE IS DOMINATED BY THE

00:01:21.981 --> 00:01:28.021
PRIVATE MILITARY GROUPS.
WAGNER HEAD YEVGENY PRIGOZHIN

00:01:28.021 --> 00:01:31.090
PRAISING THE BRAVERY OF THE
UKRAINIAN FORCES HE IS TRYING

00:01:31.090 --> 00:01:34.027
TO DEFEAT.
IT MEETING ON SUNDAY THAT HIS

00:01:34.027 --> 00:01:38.364
MEN WERE EXCLUSIVELY WORKING TO
CAPTURE THE TOWN IN THE MINES

00:01:38.364 --> 00:01:41.701
UNDERNEATH SOLEDAD FROM
BUCKINGHAM.

00:01:41.701 --> 00:01:45.171
THE TOWN WALLS ARE ALMOST
ENTIRELY DEMOLISHED.

00:01:45.171 --> 00:01:48.374
ACCORDING TO UKRAINIAN
OFFICIALS.

00:01:48.374 --> 00:01:53.446
SOLEDAR, THOSE SMALL IN SIZE,
IS STRATEGICALLY IMPORTANT TO

00:01:53.446 --> 00:01:56.316
THE ULTIMATE CAPTURE MCNUTT.
A WAY OF SURROUNDING THE CITY

00:01:56.316 --> 00:02:01.354
FROM THE NORTH AND DISRUPTING
UKRAINE COMMUNICATION LINES.

00:02:01.354 --> 00:02:04.390
&gt;&gt; THE BATTLE FOR THE DONBAS
CONTINUES.

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:08.161
ALTHOUGH THE OCCUPIERS HAVE NO
CONCENTRATED THEIR EFFORTS ON

00:02:08.161 --> 00:02:12.699
FLORIDA, THE RESULT OF THIS
DIFFICULT AND PROLONG THE

00:02:12.699 --> 00:02:16.102
BATTLE WILL BE THE LIBERATION
OF OUR ENTIRE DONBAS.

00:02:16.102 --> 00:02:19.973
&gt;&gt; UKRAINE'S PRESIDENT
VOLODYMYR ZELENSKYY MONDAY

00:02:19.973 --> 00:02:23.109
ACKNOWLEDGED THE EXTREMELY
DIFFICULT SITUATION IN SOLEDAD.

00:02:23.109 --> 00:02:27.013
RUSSIA MEANWHILE IS STILL
REELING OVER THE DEVASTATING

00:02:27.013 --> 00:02:30.049
UKRAINIAN STRIKE ON TROOPS
HOUSED IN KYIV GOT ON NEW

00:02:30.049 --> 00:02:33.019
YEAR'S DAY.
MOSCOW SAYING THAT 89

00:02:33.019 --> 00:02:35.355
SERVICEMAN WAS KILLED.
UKRAINE SAYS THERE WERE

00:02:35.355 --> 00:02:38.157
HUNDREDS.
RUSSIA SAYS IT WILL NOT PUBLISH

00:02:38.157 --> 00:02:42.228
THEIR NAMES.
CLAIMING IT WILL HELP FOREIGN

00:02:42.228 --> 00:02:45.798
INTERNET ACTIVITIES AGAINST
THEM.

00:02:45.798 --> 00:02:50.169
AS FIGHTING RAGES ON, ALL EYES
ARE ON WHEN AND IF IT MAY FALL.

00:02:50.169 --> 00:02:56.342
SCOTT MCLAIN, CNN, KYIV.
&gt;&gt; THE PENTAGON CONFIRMS THAT

00:02:56.342 --> 00:03:00.046
IT WILL BEGIN TRAINING
UKRAINIAN TROOPS ON THE MISSILE

00:03:00.046 --> 00:03:02.048
SYSTEM IN THE U.S. AS SOON AS
NEXT WEEK.

00:03:02.048 --> 00:03:07.020
BETWEEN 90 AND 100 SOLDIERS
WILL VISIT FORT SILL IN

00:03:07.020 --> 00:03:10.023
OKLAHOMA FOR THE PROGRAM.
WHICH IS EXPECTED TO TAKE

00:03:10.023 --> 00:03:12.191
SEVERAL MONTHS.
CNN'S CLARE SEBASTIAN IS

00:03:12.191 --> 00:03:14.327
FOLLOWING THE LATEST
DEVELOPMENTS FOR US AND JOINS

00:03:14.327 --> 00:03:16.262
US LIVE FROM LONDON.
WANTING TO CLARE.

00:03:16.262 --> 00:03:20.099
WHAT MORE ARE YOU LEARNING
ABOUT THESE UKRAINIAN TROOPS

00:03:20.099 --> 00:03:23.236
SAID TO BEGIN TRAINING ON THE
PATRIOT MISSILE SYSTEM HERE IN

00:03:23.236 --> 00:03:24.570
THE U.S..
NEXT WEEK.

00:03:24.570 --> 00:03:29.008
&gt;&gt; WAS, BY A SIGNIFICANT STEP
FOR UKRAINIAN FORCES TO BE

00:03:29.008 --> 00:03:30.543
HEADING TO THE U.S. FOR
TRAINING.

00:03:30.543 --> 00:03:33.246
THE U.S. HAS FOUR CONTACTS BEEN
TRAINING FORCES IN EUROPE.

00:03:33.246 --> 00:03:37.116
PARTICULARLY IN GERMANY.
PLANNING TO STEP UP THE

00:03:37.116 --> 00:03:40.153
PROGRAM.
BUT THIS WOULD BE 9200

00:03:40.153 --> 00:03:44.090
UKRAINIAN TROOPS WHO, AS SOON
AS NEXT WEEK WILL BE HEADING TO

00:03:44.090 --> 00:03:47.226
FORT SILL IN OKLAHOMA.
THE TRAINING FACILITY THAT THE

00:03:47.226 --> 00:03:49.495
U.S. USES TO TRAIN ITS OWN
SOLDIERS.

00:03:49.495 --> 00:03:53.132
ON THAT PATRIOT BATTERY.
THEY ARE PLANNING TO EXPEDITE

00:03:53.132 --> 00:03:55.568
THE USUAL TIMELINE FOR THIS
TRAINING.

00:03:55.568 --> 00:03:59.238
TYPICALLY IT CAN TAKE UP TO A
YEAR TO TRAIN SOLDIERS TO USE

00:03:59.238 --> 00:04:01.574
THE PATRIOT MISSILE DEFENSE
SYSTEM.

00:04:01.574 --> 00:04:04.544
BUT THEY PLAN TO GET IT DONE IN
SEVERAL MONTHS.

00:04:04.544 --> 00:04:07.480
CLEARLY THEY WANT TO EXPEDITE
TO MINIMIZE THE AMOUNT OF TIME

00:04:07.480 --> 00:04:10.583
THAT THE TROOPS SPEND AWAY FROM
THE BATTLEFIELD.

00:04:10.583 --> 00:04:14.020
AND TO GET THE PATRIOT BATTERY
TO WHERE IT IS NEEDED THE MOST.

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:17.190
PRESIDENT ZELENSKYY STEPPING UP
HIS CALL FOR WESTERN AID IN HIS

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:19.959
NIGHTLY ADDRESS TUESDAY.
SAYING THAT THIS IS NOT EVEN

00:04:19.959 --> 00:04:23.129
MORE IMPORTANT WITH RUSSIA
POTENTIALLY PLANNING A ANOTHER

00:04:23.129 --> 00:04:25.231
ESCALATION.
I THINK SEVERAL MONTHS IS

00:04:25.231 --> 00:04:28.334
PERHAPS TOO LONG FOR THE
PATRIOT MISSILE TO PLAY A KEY

00:04:28.334 --> 00:04:33.038
ROLE IN THE NEAR FUTURE.
BUT CLEARLY, STILL A VERY

00:04:33.038 --> 00:04:37.310
PRIZED ADDITION TO THE WESTERN
MILITARY AID PACKAGE UKRAINE IS

00:04:37.310 --> 00:04:39.178
SEEN.
&gt;&gt; ALL RIGHT, OUR THANKS TO

00:04:39.178 --> 00:04:41.481
CLARE SEBASTIAN JOINING US LIVE
FROM LONDON.

